{"id":"4038af0062cf","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey","lang":"en","title":"Placement Survey","description":"Since 2002, the Career and Alumni Service has regularly conducted a survey on the professional paths of USI graduates to identify and understand how they enter the world of work and and plan its activities and services accordingly. The survey is conducted every two years, in alte","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Info","Alumni","Alumni portraits"],"image":null,"words":332,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/indagine-laureati","en":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Info","path":"/en/originalnode/14049"},{"label":"Alumni","path":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"Alumni portraits","path":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits"},{"label":"Placement Survey","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Since 2002, the Career and Alumni Service has regularly conducted a survey on the professional paths of USI graduates to identify and understand how they enter the world of work and and plan its activities and services accordingly. </p> <p>The survey is conducted every two years, in alternation with the Statistical Office of the Canton Ticino (USTAT). The online questionnaire is sent to alumni from all USI faculties (Architecture, Biomedical Sciences, Communication, Culture and Society, Economics, and Informaics) and degree levels (Bachelor’s, Master’s, PhD), one year and five years after graduation. The data collected is processed in aggregated form. </p> <p><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2024_information_on_personal_data_processing_of_usi_graduates.pdf\"><em>Information on personal data processing of USI graduates</em></a></p> <p><strong>2026 Placement Survey </strong></p> <p>The 21st USI Placement Survey involves 692 USI alumni from the Class of 2021 and 1,056 USI alumni from the Class of 2025. </p> <p>The results of the 2026 survey will be available from January 2027 on this website. </p><p><strong>Previous Surveys:</strong></p> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2024 (20th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2024_survey_all-2019_web.pdf\">Results 2024 (at 5 years)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-alumni_2024_placement_survey-classe2023-.pdf\">Results 2024 (at 1 year)</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2022 (19th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2022_master_survey_all_masters-web-short_def.pdf\">Results 2022 (at 5 years)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2022_placement_survey-class_2021_short.pdf\">Results 2022 (at 1 year)</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2021 (18th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2021_report_usi_master_survey-web.pdf\">Results 2021</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2020 (17th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-2020_report_usi_master_survey-web.pdf\">Results 2020</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-brochure_placement_report_2020-eng.pdf\">Leaflet 2020</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://www3.ti.ch/DFE/DR/USTAT/index.php?fuseaction=pubblicazioni.dettaglioVolume&amp;idCollana=121&amp;idVolume=2501\">Dalle scuole universitarie svizzere al mondo del lavoro</a> (pubblication with Ustat)</li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2018 (16th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2018-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2018</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/flyer-placement-report-sintesi-2019-eng-web.pdf\">Leaflet 2018</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2017 (15th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2017-slides-en.pdf\">Results_2017</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2016 (13th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-10-years-indagine-en.pdf\">Results_2016</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2015 (12th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2015-slides-en.pdf\">Results_2015</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2014 (11th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2014-slides-en.pdf\">Results_2014</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-risultati-indagine-2014-en.pdf\">Press release 2014</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2013 (10th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2013-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2013</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-risultati-indagine-2013-en.pdf\">Press release 2013</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2012 (9th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2012-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2012</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-risultati-indagine-2012-en.pdf\">Press release 2012</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2011 (8th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2011-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2011</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-risultati-indagine-2011-en.pdf\">Press release 2011</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2010 (7th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2010-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2010</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-comunicato-risultati-indagine-2010-en.pdf\">Press release 2010</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2009 (6th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2009-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2009</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2008 (5th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-indagine-laureati-2008-slide-en.pdf\">Results_2008</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2007 (4th)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2007.pdf\">Results_2007</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2005 (3rd)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2005.pdf\">Results_2005</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2004 (2nd)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2004.pdf\">Results_2004</a></li> </ul> <p><strong>USI Alumni Placement Survey 2002 (1st)</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/alumni/alumni-sintesi-risultati-2002.pdf\">Results_2002</a></li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni"},{"label":"My Alumni profile","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/profile"},{"label":"My career story","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/my-career-story"},{"label":"Benefits","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefits"},{"label":"My Chapter","href":"/en/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Alumni calendar","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/alumni-calendar"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Key figures","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-graduates"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Placement survey","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/portraits/survey"},{"label":"Chapters","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/chapters"},{"label":"Executive Alumni","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/executive-alumni"},{"label":"Master groups","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/network/master-groups"},{"label":"AMA","href":"/en/universita/info/alumni/network/ama"},{"label":"Career calendar","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/events/career-calendar"},{"label":"Job offers","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/job-internship-offers"},{"label":"Career counselling","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/careers/career-counselling"},{"label":"Alumni News","href":"/en/university/info/alumni/